---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Submit a Request | Mill City Web Studio" description="Tell Mill City Web Studio about your business and website project.">
  <section class="section-shell page-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Submit a request</div>
    <h1>Tell us about your business and what you need.</h1>
    <p>You don’t need a polished project brief. Share a few details about your business, your current site if you have one, and what you’d like help with.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell contact-grid">
    <form class="contact-form" action="mailto:hello@example.com" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
      <label>Name<input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required /></label>
      <label>Email<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required /></label>
      <label>Business or organization<input type="text" name="business" autocomplete="organization" required /></label>
      <label>Current website <span class="field-note">optional</span><input type="url" name="website" inputmode="url" placeholder="https://" /></label>
      <label>What can we help with?
        <select name="project" required>
          <option value="">Select one</option>
          <option>New website</option>
          <option>Website redesign</option>
          <option>Hosting / maintenance</option>
          <option>Website updates</option>
          <option>Not sure yet</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label>Tell us about your business and project<textarea name="message" rows="7" placeholder="What does your business do? What would you like the website to help you accomplish?" required></textarea></label>
      <label>Timing <span class="field-note">optional</span>
        <select name="timing">
          <option value="">No specific timeline</option>
          <option>As soon as possible</option>
          <option>Within 1–2 months</option>
          <option>Within 3–6 months</option>
          <option>Just exploring</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <button class="button primary" type="submit">Submit request</button>
      <p class="form-note">The request form is being prepared for launch. We’ll connect it to the Mill City Web Studio business inbox once the new email address is ready.</p>
    </form>

    <aside class="contact-aside">
      <div class="eyebrow">What happens next</div>
      <h2>We’ll review your request and get back to you.</h2>
      <p>We’ll start by learning about your business, what you already have, and what you want the site to do for you.</p>
      <div class="contact-rule"></div>
      <p>No need to know the technical details or have everything figured out before reaching out.</p>
      <div class="contact-rule"></div>
      <p class="aside-small">Projects can include a new website, a redesign, desktop and mobile layouts, domain and hosting setup, forms or booking connections, search fundamentals, and ongoing support.</p>
    </aside>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
